{"c":[{"name":"20261008T122806Z-20adf579b39b18f9","text":"Candidate generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not elapsed time; no setGeneratorClock, budgetMs or --generator-clock override remains. stats.ms is diagnostic, and a visit-cap stop still marks a partial window cut.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T131449Z-7a0add213d3fc6e0","text":"Tests that wire page sessions into Helper must close those sessions before Helper.shutdown and Store.close; a scheduled trailing walk otherwise reaches a closed store.","type":"note"}]}
